# Upstream Zephyr sources its video drivers inside "if VIDEO"; match that, or a
# driver with "default y" gated only on its DT node activates in every sysbuild
# image. Sysbuild applies shield overlays to the bootloader too, so a camera
# shield would otherwise pull video drivers -- and whatever they select -- into
# MCUboot, which has no video subsystem.
if VIDEO
rsource "video/Kconfig"
endif
endmenu
